<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan scraps tender for 25,000 tonnes sugar.</title>
<headline>Pakistan scraps tender for 25,000 tonnes sugar.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The state-run Trading Corporation of Pakistan (TCP) on Friday cancelled its June 7 tender for 25,000 tonnes of white refined crystal sugar for delivery at Karachi port or nearby Port Qasim by July 31.</p>
</text>
